  "description": "HubSpot marketing email engagement events - GET /email/public/v1/events. One row per event; nested location/browser/sentBy objects flattened. Covers OPEN and CLICK event types; CLICK adds url/link_id/link_id_v2/referer, OPEN adds duration and location lat/long/zipcode - each is NULL on the other type. NOTE: the records array is under 'events', NOT 'results' - this source_path overrides ingestion_config. Pagination is offset-based via top-level hasMore/offset.",
